Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 10:00:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] pmdomain: mediatek: add MT6897 SPM and hardware-voter domains

Describe MT6897 SPM and MM hardware-voter domains, preserve modem reset
semantics and apply buck isolation after the power-off acknowledgement.
Detach external child-parent links when their controller is removed.

